From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UN1CA Build System <noreply@localhost>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 05:22:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: exynos9830: enable vhost VSOCK for Android Perfetto

Android 17's traced service opens a vsock listener for its host endpoint.
Without AF_VSOCK support, socket creation fails with EAFNOSUPPORT and init
restarts traced continuously, repeatedly invoking the updatable-process
health check.  The VSOCKETS option only builds the common code: this 4.19
tree registers AF_VSOCK from a transport's vsock_core_init() callback. Build
the vhost transport in as well so the host listener used by traced can create
the socket on physical devices.
---
 arch/arm64/configs/exynos9830_defconfig | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/exynos9830_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/exynos9830_defconfig
index 7bf7fdcd8741..f02e5bc7028 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/exynos9830_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/exynos9830_defconfig
@@ -595,7 +595,7 @@ CONFIG_HAVE_ARM_SMCCC=y
 #
 # Tegra firmware driver
 #
-# CONFIG_VIRTUALIZATION is not set
+CONFIG_VIRTUALIZATION=y
 CONFIG_ARM64_CRYPTO=y
 CONFIG_CRYPTO_SHA256_ARM64=y
 # CONFIG_CRYPTO_SHA512_ARM64 is not set
@@ -1291,7 +1291,8 @@ CONFIG_NET_ACT_TUNNEL_KEY=y
 CONFIG_NET_SCH_FIFO=y
 # CONFIG_DCB is not set
 # CONFIG_DNS_RESOLVER is not set
 # CONFIG_BATMAN_ADV is not set
 # CONFIG_OPENVSWITCH is not set
-# CONFIG_VSOCKETS is not set
+CONFIG_VSOCKETS=y
+CONFIG_VHOST_VSOCK=y
 # CONFIG_NETLINK_DIAG is not set
-- 
